  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b240cdd430e51cb4ab072717b9af7895, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial
  tutorialSlides:
  - tutorialText: When you open you kitchen, people will bring ingredients. You can
      learn about their dislikes, what they need and what they can offer.
    tutorialImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: abc2f1de432327744b9afd291a66d46a, type: 3}
  - tutorialText: Then you cook the soup. If you pick an ingredient that some person
      doesn't like, they won't come to dinner
    tutorialImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d7130d3c71dac494485faeed53613ead, type: 3}
  - tutorialText: At dinner people who came exchange what they need and what they
      can offer. Try to find all the matches!
    tutorialImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36feba14dfda26b40b6ec529e0fed46c, type: 3}
